<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 27.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 27.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Tuesday, May 27:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,569.90 (1,574.10)	CHF  1,120.20 (1,116.80)</p>
<p>    DEM    929.71 (929.77)	  GBP  2,575.60 (2,565.80)</p>
<p>    ATS    132.10 (132.12)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Monday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $20.80 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$16.04 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $36.84 million ($25.84 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
